  the legacy top-level `utils` package.
- **CLI-13** *(Low)* `aitbc_cli/commands/client.py` is an unregistered empty stub group; three
  differently-purposed "agent" groups (`agent_sdk.py`→`agent`, `agent.py`→`agent-msg`,
  `agent_comm.py`) are disambiguated only by import aliases.

